Executive Takeaway
95.0M Past Due is primarily driven by PT (66.7M), with the largest root causes being deductions backlog, EDI failures, quality/warranty disputes, pricing discrepancies and freight/documentation issues. A relatively small group of strategic customers accounts for a significant portion of the risk, making focused resolution of Top-20 accounts the fastest path to cash recovery and Past Due reduction. 

